     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,sans-serif;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><font size=\"2\">I have been working with 5 imputed datasets, and during my SEM analysis I&#39;ve been getting &quot;Inf&quot; value for some (but not all) of the degrees of freedom. I don&#39;t know what the problem is here. Here is my model and what I did: </font></span></p><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><font size=\"2\"><br></font></span></p><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\">ModelM&lt;- &#39; </font></p><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\"># Measurement Part</font></p><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\"><br></font></p><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\">SACQAA =~ Q17_1+Q17_2 + Q17_3neg + Q17_4neg + Q17_5 + Q17_6neg + Q17_7 + Q17_8neg + Q17_9 + Q17_10neg + Q17_11 + Q17_12neg + Q17_13neg + Q17_14 + Q17_15neg + Q17_16neg + Q17_17 + Q17_18 + Q17_19 + Q17_20neg + Q17_21 + Q17_22neg + Q17_23 + Q17_24</font></p><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\">SACQSA =~ Q18_1+Q18_2 + Q18_3 + Q18_4 + Q18_5 + Q18_6 + Q18_7 + Q18_8neg + Q18_9 + Q18_10 + Q18_11 + Q18_12neg + Q18_13 + Q18_14neg + Q18_15neg + Q18_16neg + Q18_17neg + Q18_18 + Q18_19</font></p><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\"><br></font></p><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\"># Regressions</font></p><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\">SACQAA ~ explor+commit+instr+coethinstr+eicoethinstr</font></p><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\">SACQSA ~ explor+commit+Colfriend+coethfriend+eicoethfriend</font></p><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\"><br></font></p><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\"># Correlatioins</font></p><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\">SACQAA ~~ SACQSA</font></p><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\">explor ~~ commit</font></p><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\"><br></font></p><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\">&#39;</font></p><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\">#free model</font></p><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\">modelS &lt;- runMI(ModelM, estimator=&quot;MLR&quot;, data=datanew, fun=&quot;sem&quot;)</font></p><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"></span></font></p><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\">summary(modelS, fit.measures=TRUE, standardized= TRUE)</font></p></div><div style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,sans-serif;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><font size=\"2\"> </font></span></p></div><div style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,sans-serif;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><font size=\"2\"><br></font></span></p><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><font size=\"2\">Here is a portion of the output:</font></span></p><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><font size=\"2\">Regressions:                   Estimate  Std.Err  t-value       df  P(&gt;|t|)   Std.lv  Std.all  </font></span></p></div><div style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,sans-serif;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><font size=\"2\">SACQAA ~                                                                         </font></span></p></div><div style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,sans-serif;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><font size=\"2\">explor           -0.021    0