s-serif;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><font size=\"2\">eicoethinstr     -0.000    0.002   -0.250      Inf    0.803   -0.000   -0.013  </font></span></p></div><div style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,sans-serif;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><font size=\"2\"> </font></span></p></div><div style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,sans-serif;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><font size=\"2\">SACQSA ~                                                                           </font></span></p></div><div style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,sans-serif;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><p style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><font size=\"2\">explor            0.010    0.020   